			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1733,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove dead code and consolidate RPC module documentation\n\nEliminate unused module declarations across the codebase: dead `Hover` and `DefaultConfigurations`/`NLSResolver` modules, legacy `Enhanced` subdirectory, unused `Error` re-export, and 11 dormant RPC scaffolding modules (Types, EchoAction, Commands, Workspace, Configuration, Windows, Terminals, Debug, SCM, Processes, Telemetry) and the deprecated `Vine` submodule.\n\nCondense the `Source/RPC/mod.rs` documentation to a single focused paragraph describing the active `CocoonService` surface. All 80+ lines of dead code and orphaned `pub mod` declarations are removed.\n\nThis cleanup reduces noise in the module tree and ensures only actively-calls paths remain in scope.",
			"SHA": "63dcc59984f7f4356ef400c52867997e543ff63d"
